# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day36

## Topic
# 비교급 & 최상급
### Comparative / Superlative

---

## 1. 비교급

두 대상을 비교할 때 사용한다.

### 짧은 형용사

형용사 + -er + than

small → smaller than

fast → faster than

cheap → cheaper than

### Example

This computer is **faster than** that one.

→ 이 컴퓨터가 저것보다 더 빠르다.

---

## 2. 긴 형용사

more + 형용사 + than

convenient
→ more convenient

efficient
→ more efficient

expensive
→ more expensive

### Example

Online shopping is **more convenient than** traditional shopping.

---

## 3. 최상급

셋 이상을 비교해서
가장 ~한 것을 표현한다.

### 짧은 형용사

the + 형용사-est

small → the smallest

fast → the fastest

cheap → the cheapest

### 긴 형용사

the most + 형용사

the most convenient

the most efficient

the most expensive

---

## 4. 불규칙 비교급

| 원급 | 비교급 | 최상급 |
|---|---|---|
| good | better | best |
| bad | worse | worst |
| many/much | more | most |
| little | less | least |

---

## 5. TOEIC에서 자주 나오는 표현

### much / far / even + 비교급

much better

far more efficient

even faster

### Example

This system is **much more efficient** than the old one.

---

## 6. the 비교급, the 비교급

~할수록 더 ~

The more you practice, the better you become.

→ 연습하면 할수록 더 잘하게 된다.

---

## 7. 비교급 + and + 비교급

점점 더 ~

The weather is getting **warmer and warmer**.

The company is becoming **more and more successful**.

---

## Quick Test

This model is _____ than the previous one.

A. efficient
B. more efficient
C. most efficient
D. the most efficient

Answer: B

→ 두 대상을 비교
→ more efficient than
